    <node id="&quot;RACHEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rachel is Yibing Maxine Tan's old friend, a violinist with a wild mane of curly hair and a smile that could light up a room, and someone who catches up with Maxine on campus."</data>
